---
/**
 * A review note in the draft privacy policy (src/data/privacy.ts): [CONFIRM: …] where only the
 * owner can say, and [CHECK WITH A LAWYER] under a section that depends on local law. A `mark`,
 * since the text is flagged for attention, in the primary yellow with the page's dark text, so
 * every note stands out from the policy around it. It wraps with its padding on every line.
 */
---

<mark class="rounded-sm bg-primary box-decoration-clone px-1 font-bold text-base-content">
  <slot />
</mark>
